      "base_revision": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "# Overview\n\nAtlas prepares a constrained service rollout. The gradual rollout is approved; endpoint verification remains active. [Probe availability](@met-availability) is measured by successful probe requests within each report window.\n\n[[prj-atlas]]\n\n[[met-availability]]\n\n# Architecture\n\nThe rollout controller gates exposure; the verification task checks the intended endpoint before completion.\n\n[[cmp-controller]]\n\n# Plan\n\n[[goal-release]]\n\n[[task-verify]]\n\n[[*]]{type=task status=active view=list}\n\n# Decisions\n\nThe gradual rollout limits exposure while verification is still pending. Its adoption does not establish that rollout has happened.\n\n[[dec-gradual]]\n\n# Evolution\n\nThe initial choice limits exposure while verification remains unresolved.\n\n# Log\n\n[[src-probes-first]]\n\n[[evd-probes-first]]\n",
        "fields": {
          "d": [
            "Atlas rollout purpose, current choices and verified probe observations."
          ]
        },
        "records": [
          {
            "type": "project",
            "id": "prj-atlas",
            "fields": {
              "t": [
                "Atlas rollout"
              ],
              "d": [
                "Prepare and verify a constrained service rollout."
              ],
              "x": [
